# Agent scratch space, not project config. Deliberately NOT the whole .claude/
# directory: a committed .claude/settings.json is how a project shares its hooks
# and permissions with everyone working on it, and ignoring the parent would
# silently swallow that the day someone adds one.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
